        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0546" n="444" xml:id="pg444"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/12495: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai (Cunningham) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-29T19:00:00+08:00">October 29, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 29—6:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>T. V. Soong has presented his resignation as Minister of Finance which has been
                    accepted, H. H. Kung has been appointed as successor. Soong will continue to be
                    connected with the National Economic Council.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cunningham</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
